    {
      "text": "An Aurorus was found frozen solid within a glacier, just as it appeared long ago, which became quite a big event in the news.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "This usually quiet and kindly Pokémon has a surface temperature of around –240 degrees Fahrenheit.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Aurorus was restored from a fossil. It’s said that when this Pokémon howls, auroras appear in the night sky.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "When gripped by rage, Aurorus will emanate freezing air, covering everything around it in ice.",
